#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:1 2728ba7994c84049b04211b850a1de06
msgid "🔖 Metadata"
msgstr "🔖 元数据"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:3 9d1c9ef0d4e94d4fbedbe8e5027c7e4b
msgid ""
"Each module has a `module.bs` file, and each bundle has a `bundle.bs` "
"file. These files describe the bundle, the module, and its features. The "
"build uses them to generate the function tags, the documentation, and the"
" editor completion. The `uv run check` command checks them. See the "
"[validation page](project:validation.md)."
msgstr ""
"每个模块都有一个 `module.bs` 文件，每个捆绑包都有一个 `bundle.bs` "
"文件。这些文件描述捆绑包、模块及其特性。构建过程用它们生成函数标签、文档和编辑器补全。`uv run check` "
"命令会检查它们。参见[验证页面](project:validation.md)。"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:5 b83b0fb1848d40f7aa204fbcf651dc37
msgid ""
"This page covers the basics. To learn more of the syntax, read the "
"`module.bs` files of other modules."
msgstr "本页只介绍基础内容。要了解更多语法，请阅读其他模块的 `module.bs` 文件。"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 92ed24a5ddc0499987c1516bdcf07de9
msgid "Editor support"
msgstr "编辑器支持"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:10 d7e3e113d7ef48d69d2d4b4fca46927b
msgid ""
"The `mcbookshelf.vscode-bsdoc` extension for VS Code highlights and "
"checks `.bs` files."
msgstr "VS Code 的 `mcbookshelf.vscode-bsdoc` 扩展可以高亮并检查 `.bs` 文件。"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:15 62d7eb4e772a4eb69b147b5d8f178add
msgid "Bundle metadata"
msgstr "捆绑包元数据"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:17 3187b276a4b54de5a5d77c4b7c24eac7
msgid ""
"A bundle is a set of modules in one pack. Its folder name starts with "
"`@`, for example `modules/@bs.runtime`. Its `bundle.bs` file starts with "
"a description of the bundle. The properties follow:"
msgstr ""
"捆绑包是打包在一起的一组模块。它的文件夹名称以 `@` 开头，例如 `modules/@bs.runtime`。它的 `bundle.bs` "
"文件以捆绑包的描述开头，随后是各项属性："

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 5b5f7f15ec254b15990329a77b6bf3f9
msgid "Property"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 bd7562db7e8742e6b8015c517130976f
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 4c11668d2b284f12869661b744d0681b
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必需"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 489dac7cc782448a97c2acaf75e8a46e
msgid "name"
msgstr "name"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 46cc564bc4104b58ad7b70d24079b2cd
msgid "The display name of the bundle, for example `Runtime`"
msgstr "捆绑包的显示名称，例如 `Runtime`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 93267435c6454cb28525249626172fc8
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 fc734b2bd26842d4a73facec81288810
msgid "slug"
msgstr "slug"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 16e2425b1985462fa0682f010047165f
msgid "The name used to publish the bundle, for example `bookshelf-runtime`"
msgstr "用于发布捆绑包的名称，例如 `bookshelf-runtime`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 5aa4a925c75349e59ed949b314807e2f
msgid "version"
msgstr "version"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 46cc564bc4104b58ad7b70d24079b2cd
msgid "The version of the bundle, for example `5.0.0`"
msgstr "捆绑包的版本，例如 `5.0.0`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 19caecd777a2479d928922ac27e7b312
msgid "tags"
msgstr "tags"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 be8fd2de259d4678b1e2b7c2dd397d84
msgid ""
"A list of tags. The bundle includes every released module that has one of"
" them"
msgstr "标签列表。捆绑包会包含拥有其中某个标签的所有已发布模块"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 4dcce364cb424f7489e803cf08f66139
msgid "documentation"
msgstr "documentation"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 342a9960f4c342f9839d49e6366c4202
msgid "A link to the bundle documentation"
msgstr "捆绑包文档的链接"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 776d8d6598d143d4892472e63614ce07
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:38 a4b1d296fc7a46ee92a6647b1ec3dcfc
msgid "Module metadata"
msgstr "模块元数据"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:40 46cc564bc4104b58ad7b70d24079b2cd
msgid ""
"The `module.bs` file starts with a description of the module. The "
"properties follow:"
msgstr "`module.bs` 文件以模块的描述开头，随后是各项属性："

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 46cc564bc4104b58ad7b70d24079b2cd
msgid "The display name of the module, for example `Health`"
msgstr "模块的显示名称，例如 `Health`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 16e2425b1985462fa0682f010047165f
msgid "The name used to publish the module, for example `bookshelf-health`"
msgstr "用于发布模块的名称，例如 `bookshelf-health`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 631d748d3a704ed6a9b85e2777eacfa3
msgid ""
"The version of the module, for example `5.0.0`. See the [changelog "
"page](project:changelog.md)"
msgstr "模块的版本号，例如 `5.0.0`。参见[更新日志页面](project:changelog.md)"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 8e21520dac924d05be1f21f52d6f5a1a
msgid ""
"A list of tags. Bundles use them to select modules, for example `runtime`"
" or `dev`"
msgstr "标签列表。捆绑包用它们来选择模块，例如 `runtime` 或 `dev`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 342a9960f4c342f9839d49e6366c4202
msgid ""
"A link to the module documentation. The default is its page in "
"`docs/modules`"
msgstr "模块文档的链接。默认为其在 `docs/modules` 中的页面"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 a6f261ea391343eea419595ceed7ca91
msgid "weak_dependencies"
msgstr "weak_dependencies"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 f932d4d5a53b4fdfa2d61f86e8313414
msgid ""
"Modules that improve this one but that it can work without, for example "
"`bs.log`"
msgstr "能增强本模块、但并非必需的模块，例如 `bs.log`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:60 981517bd6cfd4bf8a6bc521e6648e00e
msgid ""
"You don't declare dependencies. The build finds them in the module files."
" For example, a call to `#bs.hitbox:get_block/collision` makes the module"
" depend on `bs.hitbox`."
msgstr ""
"你无需声明依赖项。构建会在模块的文件中找到它们。例如，调用 `#bs.hitbox:get_block/collision` 会让模块依赖 "
"`bs.hitbox`。"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:64 c0528a3eabf24e65878d79f79fce139e
msgid "Feature metadata"
msgstr "特性元数据"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:66 160883f6c02745b58514e92870eba9dc
msgid ""
"The features come after the module properties. Declare each feature with "
"its type, its name, and a description:"
msgstr "特性位于模块属性之后。声明每个特性时，写明它的类型、名称和描述："

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:83 37752470698147d0b6ce8fd8d23c9d6d
msgid ""
"The type is one of `function`, `predicate`, `loot_table`, "
"`context_int_provider`, `context_float_provider`, `block_tag`, or "
"`entity_type_tag`."
msgstr ""
"类型是 "
"`function`、`predicate`、`loot_table`、`context_int_provider`、`context_float_provider`、`block_tag`"
" 或 `entity_type_tag` 之一。"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 3f1943d3e8c24604ae70608e6f00aea2
msgid "authors"
msgstr "authors"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 5397a6fdc9d8428b843488821cd0105a
msgid "A list of the feature authors"
msgstr "特性的作者列表"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 957662aab38447aea8af9bedff8e58bb
msgid "contributors"
msgstr "contributors"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 b358672ee7f74cd3add3b4949d7f8fec
msgid "A list of people who helped, for example with ideas or fixes"
msgstr "提供过帮助的人员列表，例如提出想法或修复问题"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 67a31fc244b444b180e677d759fe0dd8
msgid "created"
msgstr "created"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 f340575907fb47a99b8b79ea28563bf6
msgid "The date and Minecraft version when the feature was created"
msgstr "特性创建时的日期和 Minecraft 版本"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 8e986dfa2b774436af772024ed93cf84
msgid "updated"
msgstr "updated"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 f340575907fb47a99b8b79ea28563bf6
msgid "The date and Minecraft version of the last change"
msgstr "最近一次修改的日期和 Minecraft 版本"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 e79a82d7286d465c985cad4e0dccad93
msgid "deprecated"
msgstr "deprecated"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 3363fe9fdf414e7a9e2455e5051c4bb2
msgid "Set to `true` when users should stop using the feature"
msgstr "当用户应停止使用该特性时设为 `true`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 8d720c58bfca4942929b74c4809edc3b
msgid "experimental"
msgstr "experimental"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:7 523004d96fbb480ea5f8cf9e3402df7f
msgid "Set to `true` when the feature isn't ready. Only nightly builds include it"
msgstr "当特性尚未就绪时设为 `true`。只有每夜构建包含它"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:94 35dd2dc5afe9497489a2e23ef4381adc
msgid ""
"A description starts with `>`. Describe only what this feature does. "
"Explain ideas that several features share on the documentation page of "
"the module."
msgstr "描述以 `>` 开头。只描述该特性本身的作用。多个特性共享的概念请在模块的文档页面中说明。"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:96 122374e2a5ea4fb5843aa64b6f865211
msgid "Context, inputs, and outputs"
msgstr "上下文、输入和输出"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:98 3fa4a9f6af3a424f85d9d941958e3901
msgid ""
"The lines that start with `context`, `input`, and `output` describe how "
"to use the feature. They appear in the documentation, and editors use "
"them for completion."
msgstr "以 `context`、`input` 和 `output` 开头的行描述如何使用特性。它们会显示在文档中，编辑器也用它们来提供补全。"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:101 417ff6e099be41f8aa5c280e291d0340
msgid "`context`"
msgstr "`context`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:102 96a070579d814fb0b21421b10e8313d5
msgid ""
"How the feature must run: `executor`, `position`, `rotation`, or "
"`dimension`"
msgstr "特性必须以何种方式运行：`executor`、`position`、`rotation` 或 `dimension`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:103 115df7b16de5436abdc07622f34ed57a
msgid "`input arguments`"
msgstr "`input arguments`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:104 bb711dd9fd874bfca6e3290ea3022aeb
msgid ""
"Data that the feature reads from the storage `<module>:<feature>`, at the"
" path `in`. Users can also [call the feature with a macro](#contribute-"
"calling-a-feature). Optional entries, marked with `?`, go in a `with` "
"argument"
msgstr ""
"特性从存储 `<module>:<feature>` 的 `in` 路径读取的数据。用户还可以[用宏调用该特性](#contribute-"
"calling-a-feature)。带 `?` 标记的可选条目归入 `with` 参数"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:105 e1dd68fd04554a65b4e40ffe3a379ad2
msgid "`input storage`"
msgstr "`input storage`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:106 63fe4030bace4826bfc9c70df313c21d
msgid "Same as `input arguments`, without the macro"
msgstr "与 `input arguments` 相同，但没有宏"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:107 f181d897df2b4aaebcb16af9cf6bddd9
msgid "`input macro`"
msgstr "`input macro`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:108 ed1bdbd7851a40448b8a4bd68ef2b21c
msgid "The arguments of a `__macro__` function that you write"
msgstr "你自己编写的 `__macro__` 函数的参数"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:109 46d184e4a4704a8bb6355104462784fc
msgid "`output storage`"
msgstr "`output storage`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:110 2e44332417f24426a1c980f6d4895271
msgid ""
"Data that the feature writes to the storage `<module>:<feature>`, at the "
"path `out`"
msgstr "特性写入存储 `<module>:<feature>` 的 `out` 路径的数据"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:111 4521021360e94fa185bcd4e130617a2c
msgid "`output result`"
msgstr "`output result`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:112 73fbdee40ad249a2a8a7ea6b4e239240
msgid "The number that the feature returns"
msgstr "特性返回的数值"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:113 8cb52873e9654f5aabc652df1abe2828
msgid "`output success`"
msgstr "`output success`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:114 d0c6f48ebad3419dae3d7b8daab3b475
msgid "The feature either succeeds or fails"
msgstr "特性成功或失败"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:115 a4b3eddae3ae4966ae81fd01558366d1
msgid "`state`"
msgstr "`state`"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:116 7949c62e4a8c44d887b652c41d85071d
msgid ""
"Anything else, in plain words. Use it after `context`, `input`, or "
"`output`"
msgstr "其他任何内容，用文字描述。可用在 `context`、`input` 或 `output` 之后"

#: ../../contribute/metadata.md:119 75d60e12982143c78788e2a31529459a
msgid "To share a storage between several features, name it:"
msgstr "要在多个特性之间共享一个存储，请为它命名："

